    {
      "id": "ScratchOffCards_Text_ScratchOffCardsInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "You may buy three Scratch-Off Cards\n",
        "for {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} BP.\r",
        "Hidden on each Scratch-Off Card are\n",
        "icons of Pokémon.\r",
        "You may scratch the film off a card\n",
        "three times.\r",
        "If the same icon appears three times,\n",
        "you will win a prize, like a Berry!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous pouvez acheter trois Cartes à\n",
        "gratter pour {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} PCo.\r",
        "Des icônes représentant des Pokémon\n",
        "sont dissimulées sur chaque carte.\r",
        "Vous pouvez gratter trois cases\n",
        "sur chaque carte.\r",
        "Si vous révélez trois icônes identiques,\n",
        "vous remportez un prix, comme une Baie!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ScratchOffCards_Text_XBPForThreeCards",
      "en_US": [
